      ],
      "blockMap": {
        "0RwUOOzcb5hh": {
          "id": "0RwUOOzcb5hh",
          "parentId": "document-id",
          "align": "left",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": {
            "inlineElements": [
              {
                "color": "light_text_primary",
                "kind": "text",
                "text": {
                  "text": "“看来我不只在武学上有天赋嘛，当你的干员是不是也是一把好手？”"
                }
              }
            ],
            "kind": "body"
          }
        },
        "4XXeKnpWQ2UY": {
          "id": "4XXeKnpWQ2UY",
          "parentId": "document-id",
          "align": "left",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": {
            "inlineElements": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "text": {
                  "text": "她自幼接受母亲和谈剑堂的教导，磨练武艺。刻苦的训练不仅让她收获了过硬的战斗素养，还练就了同龄人中少有的心理素质。尽管从未亲眼见过那把传说中的赤霄剑，陈千语还是以自己独创的“赤霄剑法”为荣，行侠仗义。"
                }
              }
            ],
            "kind": "body"
          }
        },
        "joGCnNlIqoY2": {
          "id": "joGCnNlIqoY2",
          "parentId": "document-id",
          "align": "left",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": {
            "inlineElements": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "text": {
                  "text": "陈千语是终末地工业的干员，是危机处理小组的核心成员之一。"
                }
              }
            ],
            "kind": "body"
          }
        },
        "oKY0Z9qNBPhU": {
          "id": "oKY0Z9qNBPhU",
          "parentId": "document-id",
          "align": "left",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": {
            "inlineElements": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "text": {
                  "text": "“管理员，我曾听说，妈妈的剑能碰触到天上的云彩。我会做到的，然后，成为你和佩丽卡最信任的人！”"
                }
              }
            ],
            "kind": "body"
          }
        },
        "zWjT5oZGbHtC": {
          "id": "zWjT5oZGbHtC",
          "parentId": "document-id",
          "align": "left",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": {
            "inlineElements": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "text": {
                  "text": "只身仗剑游历塔卫二数年后，陈千语在佩丽卡的邀请下加入了终末地。作为天生的乐天派，陈千语以饱满的热情介入一切亟需解决的困难。"
                }
              }
            ],
            "kind": "body"
          }
        }
      },
      "authorMap": {},
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    "sourcePattern": "text_only"
  },
